{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","破晓千光"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","黄金の暁光"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","飞到半空连续发射剑气，最后一击造成额外伤害并将敌人击飞。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","空中に飛び上がって剣気を放つ。最後の一撃は追加でダメージを与え、敵を打ち上げる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯飞向半空，使自身无法被攻击，持续6秒。技能持续期间，自身的普通攻击变为向敌方最密集区域发射剑气，对半径一格范围内的所有敌人造成170% + 15% ATK点伤害。当发射最后一击时，伤害提高至250% ATK并击飞敌人。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","空中に飛び上がり、6秒間攻撃を受けなくなる。スキルの持続期間中、自身の通常攻撃が剣気に変化：敵が最も密集しているエリアを攻撃し、半径1マス以内の敵全体に170% + 15% ATKのダメージを与える。最後の一撃のダメージは250% ATKになり、敵を打ち上げる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":72,"end":78,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":80,"end":86,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":68,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":100,"end":108,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":76,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":111,"end":119,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","本技能持续期间，萨基塔里斯获得技能“珍酿乐宴”的主动加成效果。如果自身已受该加成效果影响，则在本技能持续期间不消耗该加成效果的剩余时间，直至本技能结束。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","スキルの持続期間中、「美禄の宴」のアクティブボーナス効果を獲得。すでにこのボーナス効果を獲得している場合、このスキルが終了するまで、ボーナス効果の残り時間が減少しなくなる"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","剑气的伤害提升至180% + 15% ATK，最后一击的伤害提升至260% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","剣気の与ダメージが180% + 15% ATKにUPし、最後の一撃の与ダメージが260% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":33,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":40,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","本技能持续期间，若自身参与击败敌方英雄，则可使本技能的剩余持续时间延长2秒。每次释放本技能，最多只能触发1次该效果。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","スキルの持続期間中、自身が敵英雄の撃破に関与した場合、このスキルの残り時間+2秒。この効果はこのスキルを放つごとに1回まで発動可能"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","剑气的伤害提升至190% + 15% ATK，最后一击的伤害提升至270% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","剣気の与ダメージが190% + 15% ATKにUPし、最後の一撃の与ダメージが270% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":33,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":40,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","裂空星辉"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","空裂く星光"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身的普通攻击距离提升，并能穿透敌人。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の通常攻撃の射程距離がUPし、敵を貫通するようになる"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，萨基塔里斯的普通攻击变为穿透攻击，对沿途所有敌人造成145% + 15% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：サジタリスの通常攻撃が貫通攻撃になり、貫通した敵全体に145% + 15% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","穿透攻击的伤害提升至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","貫通攻撃のダメージが150% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","若当前所处的位置不佳，萨基塔里斯会在攻击间隙瞬移至一个更好的位置。该效果每6秒至多触发一次。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","自身の立ち位置が良くない場合、サジタリスは攻撃の合間に有利な位置に瞬間移動。この効果は6秒ごとに1回まで発動可能"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","穿透攻击的伤害提升至155% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","貫通攻撃のダメージが155% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","珍酿乐宴"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","美禄の宴"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身在获得友军增益效果时获得额外增益。主动使用时为自身提升攻击力和攻击速度。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","味方によるバフを獲得した時、追加でバフを獲得。アクティブ効果：攻撃力と攻撃速度がUP"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，当自身获得一名友军施加的非永久属性提升效果时，将会积攒一层“沉醉”，使自身永久提高15%攻击力与15点攻击速度，该效果最多叠加3层，且通过每名友军最多只能触发一次。主动使用时，饮下神界佳酿，使自身提高20% + 2%攻击力与20 + 3点攻击速度，持续12秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：自身が味方1体から非永続的なステータス上昇効果を受けた時、「酔い」を1スタック獲得し、永続的に自身の攻撃力+15%、攻撃速度+15、最大3スタックまで重複可能、味方1体につき1回まで発動可能。アクティブ効果：神界の美酒を飲み、12秒間、自身の攻撃力+20% + 2%、攻撃速度+20 + 3"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":107,"end":112,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":118,"end":122,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":135,"end":140,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":148,"end":152,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每层“沉醉”提供的攻击力加成提升至16%，攻击速度加成提升至16。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「酔い」1スタックにつき、永続的に自身の攻撃力+16%、攻撃速度+16"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每层“沉醉”提供的攻击力加成提升至18%，攻击速度加成提升至18。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「酔い」1スタックにつき、永続的に自身の攻撃力+18%、攻撃速度+18"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时的加成效果提升至25% + 2%点攻击力与25 + 3点攻击速度。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果の攻撃力上昇量が25% + 2%にUPし、攻撃速度上昇量が25 + 3にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":28,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":38,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","每次普通攻击后永久提升自身攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","通常攻撃を行うたびに、永続的に自身の攻撃速度UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每次普通攻击永久提升自身3点攻击速度，至多提升30点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","通常攻撃を行うたびに、永続的に自身の攻撃速度+3、最大で+30まで"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次普通攻击永久提升自身4点攻击速度，至多提升40点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","通常攻撃を行うたびに、永続的に自身の攻撃速度+4、最大で+40まで"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次普通攻击永久提升自身5点攻击速度，至多提升50点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","通常攻撃を行うたびに、永続的に自身の攻撃速度+5、最大で+50まで"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","流光天击"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","閃光の天撃"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身获得满层“沉醉”效果时方可使用，对所有敌人造成真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","「酔い」のスタック数が上限に達すると使用可能。敵全体に確定ダメージを与える"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","本技能仅在自身拥有的“沉醉”层数已叠加至满层时方可使用。短暂延迟后，召唤光枪从天而降，对场上所有敌人造成200% ATK真实伤害。本技能每场战斗最多释放3次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","自身に付与されている「酔い」のスタック数が上限に達すると使用可能。光の槍を空から降らせ、フィールド上にいる敵全体に200% ATKの確定ダメージを与える。1度の戦闘につき、3回まで発動可能"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":57,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","本技能造成的伤害提升至210% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","このスキルのダメージが210% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每场战斗首次释放本技能时，还会附带目标当前生命值20%的额外真实伤害，并会使目标在后续8秒内降低60点受愈。本技能附带的额外伤害最高不超过自身攻击力的1000%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","各戦闘で初めてこのスキルを発動する時、追加で対象の現在HP×20%の確定ダメージを与え、8秒間、対象の治癒-60。このスキルが与える追加ダメージは、自身の攻撃力×1000%を越えない"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","本技能造成的伤害提升至220% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","このスキルのダメージが220% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","主动使用技能“珍酿乐宴”时，还会提高自身的终结。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","「美禄の宴」のアクティブ効果が持続している間、自身の処断がUP"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","主动使用技能“珍酿乐宴”时，还会使自身在持续期间内提高20点终结。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「美禄の宴」のアクティブ効果が持続している間、自身の処断+20"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动使用技能“珍酿乐宴“时，饮下佳酿的速度加快50%，且佳酿持续时间内获得可以抵御60% HP的护盾。此外，在叠加满层“沉醉”后，额外提升自身25点终结。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","アクティブでスキル「美禄の宴」を発動する時、神界の美酒を飲む速度が50%速くなり、持続期間中、60% HP分のシールドを獲得。また、「酔い」のスタック数が上限に達した後、追加で自身の処断+25"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":47,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","耀空"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","グレア"]]}